---
import ManagementLayout from '../layouts/ManagementLayout.astro';
---
<ManagementLayout title="임명장·표창장 발급·대장" active="appointmentAwards">
  <div data-appointment-award-version="2026-09-02-v92.5-year-layout-recent" hidden></div>
  <div class="page-heading">
    <div>
      <p class="page-heading__kicker">APPOINTMENT · COMMENDATION CERTIFICATES</p>
      <h1>임명장·표창장 발급·대장</h1>
      <p>상장용지 원본 배경 위에 임명장 또는 표창장을 작성·미리보기·인쇄하고 발급 이력을 관리합니다.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <section class="surface award-issue-panel">
    <div class="section-title">
      <div><h2>임명장·표창장 작성</h2><p>서식 종류를 선택하면 본문 구성이 자동으로 전환됩니다. 표창장은 본문을 직접 입력할 수 있습니다.</p></div>
    </div>
    <form data-award-form novalidate>
      <div class="form-grid award-form-grid">
        <div class="form-field">
          <label for="award-document-type">발급 종류</label>
          <select id="award-document-type" name="documentType" data-document-type>
            <option value="임명장">임명장</option>
            <option value="표창장">표창장</option>
          </select>
        </div>
        <div class="form-field">
          <label for="award-serial-no">연번 (자동부여)</label>
          <input id="award-serial-no" name="serialNo" maxlength="40" value="" readonly aria-readonly="true" />
          <small class="field-help">임명장과 표창장은 종류별로 별도 순번이 자동 부여됩니다.</small>
        </div>
        <div class="award-field-row award-field-row--three">
          <div class="form-field">
            <label for="award-header-position">상단 직위명</label>
            <input id="award-header-position" name="headerPosition" maxlength="80" placeholder="예: 총무원장" />
          </div>
          <div class="form-field">
            <label for="award-recipient-name">성명</label>
            <input id="award-recipient-name" name="recipientName" maxlength="80" />
          </div>
          <div class="form-field">
            <label for="award-dharma-name">불명</label>
            <input id="award-dharma-name" name="dharmaName" maxlength="80" />
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="form-field" data-appointment-only>
          <label for="award-body-organization">본문 발행단위</label>
          <select id="award-body-organization" name="bodyOrganization">
            <option value="종단">종단</option>
            <option value="香天寺">香天寺</option>
          </select>
        </div>
        <div class="form-field" data-appointment-only>
          <label for="award-appointment-position">임명 직위명</label>
          <input id="award-appointment-position" name="appointmentPosition" maxlength="80" placeholder="예: 총무원장" />
        </div>
        <div class="form-field form-field--full appointment-body-preview" data-appointment-only>
          <span class="field-label">임명장 본문 자동구성</span>
          <div data-appointment-body-preview></div>
          <small>원본 양식 문구를 유지하며 ‘본문 발행단위’와 ‘임명 직위명’만 입력값으로 바뀝니다.</small>
        </div>
        <div class="form-field form-field--full" data-commendation-only hidden>
          <label for="award-commendation-text">표창장 본문</label>
          <textarea id="award-commendation-text" name="commendationText" rows="6" maxlength="1600" placeholder="표창장에 표시할 내용을 직접 입력해 주세요. 줄바꿈도 그대로 반영됩니다."></textarea>
        </div>
        <div class="award-field-row award-field-row--three award-date-row">
          <div class="form-field">
            <label for="award-buddhist-year">불기 연도 (자동)</label>
            <input id="award-buddhist-year" name="buddhistYear" type="number" min="1" max="9999" inputmode="numeric" readonly aria-readonly="true" />
          </div>
          <div class="form-field">
            <label for="award-issue-month">월</label>
            <input id="award-issue-month" name="issueMonth" type="number" min="1" max="12" inputmode="numeric" />
          </div>
          <div class="form-field">
            <label for="award-issue-day">일</label>
            <input id="award-issue-day" name="issueDay" type="number" min="1" max="31" inputmode="numeric" />
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="award-field-row award-field-row--three award-issuer-row">
          <div class="form-field">
            <label for="award-issuer-type">발행주체</label>
            <select id="award-issuer-type" name="issuerType">
              <option value="이사장">이사장</option>
              <option value="香天寺">香天寺</option>
            </select>
          </div>
          <div class="form-field">
            <label for="award-seal-type">직인·도장</label>
            <select id="award-seal-type" name="sealType">
              <option value="auto">자동 적용 (발행주체 기준)</option>
              <option value="organization">종단 직인</option>
              <option value="hyangcheonsa-juji">향천사 주지(서명용)</option>
              <option value="none">미적용</option>
            </select>
            <small class="field-help" data-seal-hint>이사장은 종단 직인, 香天寺는 향천사 주지 도장을 자동 적용합니다.</small>
          </div>
          <div class="form-field">
            <label for="award-manager-name">작성·관리 담당자</label>
            <input id="award-manager-name" name="managerName" maxlength="60" />
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="status-message" data-award-status aria-live="polite"></div>
      <div class="form-actions award-actions">
        <button type="button" class="btn btn-outline" data-load-recent>최근 작성값 불러오기</button>
        <button type="button" class="btn btn-outline" data-reset-form>새로 작성</button>
        <button type="button" class="btn btn-outline" data-preview>미리보기</button>
        <button type="button" class="btn btn-outline" data-print-current>인쇄 / PDF 저장</button>
        <button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary" data-issue>발급·대장 저장</button>
      </div>
    </form>
  </section>

  <section class="surface award-ledger">
    <div class="section-title">
      <div><h2>임명장·표창장 발급대장</h2><p>연번, 발급종류, 대상자, 불명, 직위, 불기 발급일과 취소 여부를 관리합니다.</p></div>
      <div class="toolbar award-ledger-filters">
        <select data-ledger-type aria-label="발급 종류"><option value="">전체 종류</option><option value="임명장">임명장</option><option value="표창장">표창장</option></select>
        <select data-ledger-status aria-label="상태"><option value="">전체 상태</option><option value="발급">발급</option><option value="취소">취소</option></select>
        <input type="search" data-ledger-query placeholder="연번·성명·불명·직위 검색" />
        <select data-ledger-size aria-label="페이지당 건수"><option value="10">10개</option><option value="20" selected>20개</option><option value="50">50개</option></select>
        <button type="button" class="btn btn-outline" data-ledger-search>조회</button>
        <button type="button" class="btn btn-outline" data-ledger-export>CSV</button>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="status-message" data-ledger-message aria-live="polite"></div>
    <div class="data-wrap">
      <table class="data-table award-ledger-table">
        <thead><tr><th>연번</th><th>종류</th><th>성명</th><th>불명</th><th>직위</th><th>불기 발급일</th><th>발행주체</th><th>작성자</th><th>상태</th><th>관리</th></tr></thead>
        <tbody data-ledger-body><tr><td colspan="10">불러오는 중입니다.</td></tr></tbody>
      </table>
    </div>
    <div class="pagination" data-ledger-pagination></div>
  </section>

  <div class="modal-overlay" data-preview-modal hidden>
    <section class="modal award-preview-modal" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="award-preview-title">
      <header class="modal__header"><h2 id="award-preview-title">임명장·표창장 미리보기</h2><button type="button" class="modal__close" data-close-preview aria-label="닫기">×</button></header>
      <div class="modal__body"><div data-preview-container></div></div>
      <footer class="award-preview-actions"><button type="button" class="btn btn-outline" data-close-preview>닫기</button><button type="button" class="btn btn-primary" data-print-preview>인쇄 / PDF 저장</button></footer>
    </section>
  </div>

  <script is:inline>
    (()=>{
      const $=(selector,root=document)=>root.querySelector(selector);
      const $$=(selector,root=document)=>Array.from(root.querySelectorAll(selector));
      const esc=(value)=>String(value??'').replace(/[&<>"']/g,(char)=>({'&':'&amp;','<':'&lt;','>':'&gt;','"':'&quot;',"'":'&#39;'}[char]));
      const session=(()=>{try{return JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem('milgyo-system-session')||'null')}catch{return null}})();
      if(!session?.token)return;
      let page=1,pages=1,currentRows=[],lastPreview=null,canManage=false;
      const api=async(url,payload)=>{const response=await fetch(url,{method:'POST',headers:{'Content-Type':'application/json'},body:JSON.stringify({token:session.token,...payload})});const data=await response.json().catch(()=>({ok:false,message:'응답을 읽을 수 없습니다.'}));if(!data.ok&&response.status===401){localStorage.removeItem('milgyo-system-session');location.replace('/');throw new Error(data.message||'로그인이 필요합니다.')}return data;};
      const todayParts=()=>{const now=new Date(Date.now()+9*60*60*1000);return {year:now.getUTCFullYear(),month:now.getUTCMonth()+1,day:now.getUTCDate()};};
      const buddhistYearFromGregorian=(year)=>Number(year||0)+544;
      const setMessage=(selector,message,type='')=>{const el=$(selector);if(!el)return;el.textContent=message||'';el.className=`status-message ${type}`;};
      const documentType=()=>String($('[name=documentType]').value||'임명장');
      const defaultCommendationText='위 불자는 평소 三寶에 귀의하는 신심이 지극하고 호국불교 이념을 실천하여 포교와 중생 구제에 헌신한 공로가 크므로, 이에 그 공로를 치하하여 이 표창장을 드립니다.';
      const appointmentBody=(values)=>`위 불자는 평소 三寶를 위하는
신심이 지극하며 호국불교 포교와
부처님의 가르침에 깊은 관심을
가져 주심으로 본 ${values.bodyOrganization||'종단'}의
${values.appointmentPosition||'○ ○ ○'}에 임명함`;
      const appointmentBodyMarkup=(values)=>`위 불자는 평소 <strong class="award-sambo">三寶</strong>를 위하는
신심이 지극하며 호국불교 포교와
부처님의 가르침에 깊은 관심을
가져 주심으로 본 ${esc(values.bodyOrganization||'종단')}의
${esc(values.appointmentPosition||'○ ○ ○')}에 임명함`;
      const syncType=()=>{const isAppointment=documentType()==='임명장';$$('[data-appointment-only]').forEach(el=>el.hidden=!isAppointment);$$('[data-commendation-only]').forEach(el=>el.hidden=isAppointment);if(!isAppointment){const text=$('[name=commendationText]');if(text&&!String(text.value||'').trim())text.value=defaultCommendationText;}syncAppointmentBody();syncSealHint();};
      const syncAppointmentBody=()=>{const values=formValues();const host=$('[data-appointment-body-preview]');if(host)host.innerHTML=appointmentBodyMarkup(values);};
      const formValues=()=>{const form=$('[data-award-form]');const data=Object.fromEntries(new FormData(form).entries());return {documentType:String(data.documentType||'임명장'),serialNo:String(data.serialNo||'').trim(),headerPosition:String(data.headerPosition||'').trim(),recipientName:String(data.recipientName||'').trim(),dharmaName:String(data.dharmaName||'').trim(),bodyOrganization:String(data.bodyOrganization||'종단'),appointmentPosition:String(data.appointmentPosition||'').trim(),commendationText:String(data.commendationText||'').trim(),buddhistYear:Number(data.buddhistYear||0)||'',issueMonth:Number(data.issueMonth||0)||'',issueDay:Number(data.issueDay||0)||'',issuerType:String(data.issuerType||'이사장'),sealType:String(data.sealType||'auto'),managerName:String(data.managerName||'').trim()};};
      const displayBody=(r)=>String(r.document_type||r.documentType)==='표창장'?String(r.commendation_text??r.commendationText??''):appointmentBody({bodyOrganization:r.body_organization??r.bodyOrganization,appointmentPosition:r.appointment_position??r.appointmentPosition});
      const displayDate=(r)=>`佛紀 ${esc(r.buddhist_year??r.buddhistYear??'0000')}年&nbsp;&nbsp; ${esc(r.issue_month??r.issueMonth??'00')}月&nbsp; ${esc(r.issue_day??r.issueDay??'00')}日`;
      const serialCache={'임명장':'','표창장':''};
      const refreshSerialPreview=async(force=false)=>{const type=documentType();const result=await api('/api/appointment-awards/query',{operation:'nextSerial',documentType:type});if(result.ok&&result.serialNo){serialCache[type]=String(result.serialNo);$('[name=serialNo]').value=serialCache[type];if(result.currentBuddhistYear)$('[name=buddhistYear]').value=String(result.currentBuddhistYear);return serialCache[type];}if(!force&&serialCache[type]){$('[name=serialNo]').value=serialCache[type];return serialCache[type];}return '';};
      const resolvedSealType=(r)=>{const selected=String(r.seal_type??r.sealType??'auto');if(selected==='auto')return String(r.issuer_type??r.issuerType??'이사장')==='香天寺'?'hyangcheonsa-juji':'organization';return selected;};
      const syncSealHint=()=>{const hint=$('[data-seal-hint]');if(!hint)return;const issuer=String($('[name=issuerType]').value||'이사장');const seal=String($('[name=sealType]').value||'auto');if(seal==='auto')hint.textContent=issuer==='香天寺'?'香天寺 발행 시 향천사 주지(서명용) 도장이 자동 적용됩니다.':'이사장 발행 시 종단 직인이 자동 적용됩니다.';else if(seal==='organization')hint.textContent='종단 직인을 적용합니다.';else if(seal==='hyangcheonsa-juji')hint.textContent='향천사 주지(서명용) 도장을 적용합니다.';else hint.textContent='직인·도장을 표시하지 않습니다.';};
      const issuerMarkup=(r)=>{const issuer=String(r.issuer_type??r.issuerType??'이사장');const sealType=resolvedSealType(r);const label=issuer==='香天寺'?'대한불교밀교종 香天寺':'대한불교밀교종 이사장';const prefix=label.slice(0,-1),last=label.slice(-1);let seal='';if(sealType==='organization')seal='<img class="award-seal award-seal--organization" src="/organization-seal-official.png?v=20260902-v924" alt="종단 직인"/>';else if(sealType==='hyangcheonsa-juji')seal='<img class="award-seal award-seal--hyangcheonsa" src="/signature-seals/hyangcheonsa-juji.png?v=20260902-v924" alt="향천사 주지 도장"/>';return `${esc(prefix)}<span class="award-issuer-seal-anchor">${esc(last)}${seal}</span>`;};
      const previewCss=`
        .award-paper-root,.award-paper-root *{box-sizing:border-box}
        .award-paper-root{background:#e2e7ed;padding:18px;overflow:auto}
        .award-paper{position:relative;width:794px;height:1123px;margin:0 auto;background:#fff;overflow:hidden;color:#111}
        .award-paper-bg{position:absolute;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:fill;z-index:0;pointer-events:none}
        .award-emblem-softener{position:absolute;left:242px;top:402px;width:310px;height:355px;z-index:1;pointer-events:none;background:radial-gradient(ellipse at center,rgba(255,255,255,.62) 0%,rgba(255,255,255,.52) 50%,rgba(255,255,255,.22) 72%,rgba(255,255,255,0) 88%)}
        .award-paper-content{position:absolute;inset:0;z-index:2;font-family:"Gungsuh","궁서","궁서체",Batang,serif}
        /* 원본 HWPX/JPG 기준 고정 좌표. 상장용지 794x1123(A4 비율)에 맞춘 값 */
        .award-serial{position:absolute;left:129px;top:169px;font-size:14pt;line-height:1.2;font-weight:400;white-space:nowrap}
        .award-title{position:absolute;left:0;right:0;top:218px;text-align:center;font-size:53pt;line-height:1;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:.22em;text-indent:.22em;white-space:nowrap}
        .award-person{position:absolute;left:154px;top:350px;width:390px;font-size:29pt;line-height:1.30;font-weight:400}
        .award-person-row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:92px minmax(0,1fr);align-items:baseline;column-gap:18px;min-height:50px}
        .award-person-label{text-align:left;white-space:nowrap;letter-spacing:0}
        .award-person-value{text-align:left;white-space:nowrap;letter-spacing:0;min-width:0}
        .award-body{position:absolute;left:72px;right:72px;text-align:center;white-space:pre;font-size:29pt;line-height:1.55;font-weight:400;word-break:keep-all;overflow-wrap:normal}
        .award-body--appointment{top:517px}
        .award-body--commendation{top:472px;bottom:255px;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;justify-content:center;overflow:hidden;white-space:pre-wrap}
        .award-sambo{font-weight:900;text-shadow:.3px 0 currentColor,-.3px 0 currentColor}
        .award-date{position:absolute;left:0;right:0;top:856px;text-align:center;font-family:"ShinMyeongGungseo","신명궁서","Gungsuh","궁서",serif;font-size:25pt;line-height:1.2;font-weight:400;white-space:nowrap}
        .award-issuer{position:absolute;left:0;right:0;top:938px;text-align:center;font-size:25pt;line-height:1.35;font-weight:400;white-space:nowrap}
        .award-issuer-seal-anchor{position:relative;display:inline-block;z-index:2}
        .award-seal{position:absolute;left:calc(50% + 5px);top:50%;transform:translate(-50%,-50%);object-fit:contain;pointer-events:none;z-index:3}
        .award-seal--organization{width:93px;height:93px}
        .award-seal--hyangcheonsa{width:66px;height:66px}
        @media print{.award-paper-root{background:#fff;padding:0}.award-paper{margin:0}@page{size:A4 portrait;margin:0}}
      `;
      const previewMarkup=(r)=>{const type=String(r.document_type??r.documentType??'임명장');const serial=String(r.serial_no??r.serialNo??'');const recipientName=String(r.recipient_name??r.recipientName??'');const dharmaName=String(r.dharma_name??r.dharmaName??'');const bodyClass=type==='표창장'?'award-body award-body--commendation':'award-body award-body--appointment';const bodyHtml=type==='표창장'?esc(displayBody(r)):appointmentBodyMarkup({bodyOrganization:r.body_organization??r.bodyOrganization,appointmentPosition:r.appointment_position??r.appointmentPosition});return `<div class="award-paper-root"><article class="award-paper"><img class="award-paper-bg" src="/certificates/appointment-award-paper.png" alt=""/><div class="award-emblem-softener" aria-hidden="true"></div><div class="award-paper-content"><div class="award-serial">${esc(serial)}</div><div class="award-title">${esc(type)}</div><div class="award-person"><div class="award-person-row"><span class="award-person-label">성 명:</span><span class="award-person-value">${esc(recipientName)}</span></div><div class="award-person-row"><span class="award-person-label">불 명:</span><span class="award-person-value">${esc(dharmaName)}</span></div></div><div class="${bodyClass}">${bodyHtml}</div><div class="award-date">${displayDate(r)}</div><div class="award-issuer">${issuerMarkup(r)}</div></div></article></div>`;};
      const openPreview=(record)=>{lastPreview=record;const overlay=$('[data-preview-modal]'),modal=$('.award-preview-modal',overlay),body=$('.modal__body',overlay),container=$('[data-preview-container]',overlay);container.innerHTML=`<style>${previewCss}</style>${previewMarkup(record)}`;overlay.hidden=false;requestAnimationFrame(()=>{if(modal)modal.scrollTop=0;if(body)body.scrollTop=0;if(container)container.scrollTop=0;const root=$('.award-paper-root',overlay);if(root)root.scrollTop=0;});};
      const printRecord=(record)=>{const win=window.open('','_blank');if(!win){alert('팝업 차단을 해제해 주세요.');return;}win.document.open();win.document.write(`<!doctype html><html lang="ko"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><title>${esc(record.document_type??record.documentType??'임명장·표창장')}</title><style>html,body{margin:0;padding:0;background:#fff}${previewCss}</style></head><body>${previewMarkup(record)}<script>addEventListener('load',()=>setTimeout(()=>print(),250));<\/script></body></html>`);win.document.close();};
      const validateIssue=(values)=>{if(!values.recipientName)return '성명을 입력해 주세요.';if(!values.buddhistYear||!values.issueMonth||!values.issueDay)return '불기 연도와 월·일을 입력해 주세요.';if(values.issueMonth<1||values.issueMonth>12||values.issueDay<1||values.issueDay>31)return '발급 월·일이 올바르지 않습니다.';if(values.documentType==='임명장'&&!values.appointmentPosition)return '임명 직위명을 입력해 주세요.';if(values.documentType==='표창장'&&!values.commendationText)return '표창장 본문을 입력해 주세요.';return '';};
      const resetForm=()=>{const date=todayParts();const form=$('[data-award-form]');form.reset();$('[name=documentType]').value='임명장';$('[name=bodyOrganization]').value='종단';$('[name=issuerType]').value='이사장';$('[name=sealType]').value='auto';$('[name=serialNo]').value='';$('[name=buddhistYear]').value=String(buddhistYearFromGregorian(date.year));$('[name=issueMonth]').value=String(date.month);$('[name=issueDay]').value=String(date.day);$('[name=commendationText]').value='';$('[name=managerName]').value=session.user?.name||'';setMessage('[data-award-status]','');syncType();syncSealHint();refreshSerialPreview(true);};
      const populateFromRow=(row)=>{const map={documentType:row.document_type,serialNo:'',headerPosition:row.header_position,recipientName:row.recipient_name,dharmaName:row.dharma_name,bodyOrganization:row.body_organization,appointmentPosition:row.appointment_position,commendationText:row.commendation_text,issuerType:row.issuer_type,sealType:row.seal_type||'auto',managerName:session.user?.name||row.manager_name};Object.entries(map).forEach(([name,value])=>{const el=$(`[name="${name}"]`);if(el)el.value=value??'';});const date=todayParts();$('[name=buddhistYear]').value=String(buddhistYearFromGregorian(date.year));$('[name=issueMonth]').value=String(date.month);$('[name=issueDay]').value=String(date.day);syncType();syncSealHint();refreshSerialPreview(true);setMessage('[data-award-status]','기존 발급값을 새 작성으로 불러왔습니다. 새 연번은 종류별로 자동 부여됩니다.','ok');scrollTo({top:0,behavior:'smooth'});};
      const loadRecent=async()=>{const type=documentType();setMessage('[data-award-status]',`${type} 최근 작성값을 불러오는 중입니다.`);const result=await api('/api/appointment-awards/query',{operation:'recent',documentType:type});if(!result.ok){setMessage('[data-award-status]',result.message||'최근 작성값을 불러오지 못했습니다.','error');return;}if(!result.row){setMessage('[data-award-status]',`${type}의 저장된 작성값이 없습니다.`,'error');return;}populateFromRow(result.row);};
      const buddhistDateText=(row)=>`佛紀 ${row.buddhist_year||''}年 ${row.issue_month||''}月 ${row.issue_day||''}日`;
      const createdText=(value)=>{const date=new Date(value);if(Number.isNaN(date.getTime()))return String(value||'');return new Intl.DateTimeFormat('ko-KR',{timeZone:'Asia/Seoul',year:'numeric',month:'2-digit',day:'2-digit',hour:'2-digit',minute:'2-digit',hour12:false}).format(date).replace(/\.$/,'');};
      const renderRows=(rows)=>{const body=$('[data-ledger-body]');if(!rows.length){body.innerHTML='<tr><td colspan="10">발급 이력이 없습니다.</td></tr>';return;}body.innerHTML=rows.map(row=>`<tr><td>${esc(row.serial_no)}</td><td>${esc(row.document_type)}</td><td>${esc(row.recipient_name)}</td><td>${esc(row.dharma_name||'-')}</td><td>${esc(row.document_type==='임명장'?(row.appointment_position||row.header_position||'-'):(row.header_position||'-'))}</td><td>${esc(buddhistDateText(row))}</td><td>${esc(row.issuer_type)}</td><td title="${esc(createdText(row.created_at))}">${esc(row.issuer_name||row.manager_name||'-')}</td><td><span class="badge badge--${esc(row.status)}">${esc(row.status)}</span></td><td><div class="award-manage"><button type="button" class="btn btn-sm btn-outline" data-row-preview="${esc(row.id)}">미리보기</button><button type="button" class="btn btn-sm btn-outline" data-row-reuse="${esc(row.id)}">값 불러오기</button>${canManage&&row.status!=='취소'?`<button type="button" class="btn btn-sm btn-outline" data-row-cancel="${esc(row.id)}">취소</button>`:''}</div></td></tr>`).join('');};
      const renderPagination=()=>{const host=$('[data-ledger-pagination]');const start=Math.max(1,page-2),end=Math.min(pages,page+2);let html=`<button type="button" ${page<=1?'disabled':''} data-page="${page-1}">이전</button>`;for(let p=start;p<=end;p++)html+=`<button type="button" class="${p===page?'active':''}" data-page="${p}">${p}</button>`;html+=`<button type="button" ${page>=pages?'disabled':''} data-page="${page+1}">다음</button>`;host.innerHTML=html;};
      const loadLedger=async(nextPage=1)=>{page=Math.max(1,nextPage);setMessage('[data-ledger-message]','조회 중입니다.');const result=await api('/api/appointment-awards/query',{operation:'list',page,pageSize:Number($('[data-ledger-size]').value)||20,query:$('[data-ledger-query]').value,status:$('[data-ledger-status]').value,documentType:$('[data-ledger-type]').value});if(!result.ok){setMessage('[data-ledger-message]',result.message||'조회에 실패했습니다.','error');return;}currentRows=result.rows||[];pages=Number(result.pages)||1;page=Number(result.page)||1;canManage=!!result.canManage;renderRows(currentRows);renderPagination();setMessage('[data-ledger-message]',`총 ${Number(result.total)||0}건`,'ok');};
      const detail=async(id)=>{const result=await api('/api/appointment-awards/query',{operation:'detail',id});if(!result.ok)throw new Error(result.message||'발급내역을 불러오지 못했습니다.');return result.row;};
      $('[name=documentType]').addEventListener('change',()=>{syncType();refreshSerialPreview();});$('[name=issuerType]').addEventListener('change',syncSealHint);$('[name=sealType]').addEventListener('change',syncSealHint);$('[name=bodyOrganization]').addEventListener('change',syncAppointmentBody);$('[name=appointmentPosition]').addEventListener('input',syncAppointmentBody);
      $('[data-load-recent]').addEventListener('click',loadRecent);
      $('[data-reset-form]').addEventListener('click',resetForm);
      $('[data-preview]').addEventListener('click',()=>openPreview(formValues()));
      $('[data-print-current]').addEventListener('click',()=>printRecord(formValues()));
      $('[data-award-form]').addEventListener('submit',async(event)=>{event.preventDefault();if(!canManage){setMessage('[data-award-status]','관리자만 발급대장에 저장할 수 있습니다.','error');return;}const values=formValues();const error=validateIssue(values);if(error){setMessage('[data-award-status]',error,'error');return;}setMessage('[data-award-status]','저장 중입니다.');const result=await api('/api/appointment-awards/action',{operation:'issue',...values});if(!result.ok){setMessage('[data-award-status]',result.message||'발급 저장에 실패했습니다.','error');return;}setMessage('[data-award-status]',result.message||'발급대장에 저장했습니다.','ok');openPreview(result.row||values);serialCache[values.documentType]='';await refreshSerialPreview(true);await loadLedger(1);});
      $$('[data-close-preview]').forEach(button=>button.addEventListener('click',()=>{ $('[data-preview-modal]').hidden=true;}));$('[data-print-preview]').addEventListener('click',()=>{if(lastPreview)printRecord(lastPreview);});
      $('[data-ledger-search]').addEventListener('click',()=>loadLedger(1));$('[data-ledger-query]').addEventListener('keydown',(event)=>{if(event.key==='Enter'){event.preventDefault();loadLedger(1);}});$('[data-ledger-size]').addEventListener('change',()=>loadLedger(1));$('[data-ledger-type]').addEventListener('change',()=>loadLedger(1));$('[data-ledger-status]').addEventListener('change',()=>loadLedger(1));
      $('[data-ledger-pagination]').addEventListener('click',(event)=>{const button=event.target.closest('[data-page]');if(!button||button.disabled)return;loadLedger(Number(button.dataset.page)||1);});
      $('[data-ledger-body]').addEventListener('click',async(event)=>{const preview=event.target.closest('[data-row-preview]'),reuse=event.target.closest('[data-row-reuse]'),cancel=event.target.closest('[data-row-cancel]');try{if(preview){openPreview(await detail(preview.dataset.rowPreview));return;}if(reuse){populateFromRow(await detail(reuse.dataset.rowReuse));return;}if(cancel){const reason=prompt('취소 사유를 입력해 주세요.');if(!reason)return;const result=await api('/api/appointment-awards/action',{operation:'cancel',id:cancel.dataset.rowCancel,reason});if(!result.ok)throw new Error(result.message||'취소에 실패했습니다.');await loadLedger(page);}}catch(error){setMessage('[data-ledger-message]',error?.message||'처리 중 오류가 발생했습니다.','error');}});
      $('[data-ledger-export]').addEventListener('click',()=>{if(!currentRows.length)return;const headers=['연번','종류','성명','불명','상단직위','임명직위','본문발행단위','불기연도','월','일','발행주체','인장','작성자','상태','작성시각'];const rows=currentRows.map(r=>[r.serial_no,r.document_type,r.recipient_name,r.dharma_name,r.header_position,r.appointment_position,r.body_organization,r.buddhist_year,r.issue_month,r.issue_day,r.issuer_type,r.seal_type||'auto',r.issuer_name||r.manager_name,r.status,r.created_at]);const safe=(v)=>{const text=String(v??'');return /^[\s]*[=+\-@]/.test(text)?`'${text}`:text;};const csv=[headers,...rows].map(row=>row.map(v=>`"${safe(v).replaceAll('"','""')}"`).join(',')).join('\r\n');const blob=new Blob(['\ufeff'+csv],{type:'text/csv;charset=utf-8'}),url=URL.createObjectURL(blob),a=document.createElement('a');a.href=url;a.download='임명장_표창장_발급대장.csv';a.click();URL.revokeObjectURL(url);});
      const init=async()=>{resetForm();const options=await api('/api/appointment-awards/query',{operation:'options'});canManage=!!options.canManage;if(options.nextSerials){serialCache['임명장']=String(options.nextSerials['임명장']||'');serialCache['표창장']=String(options.nextSerials['표창장']||'');$('[name=serialNo]').value=serialCache[documentType()]||'';}if(options.currentBuddhistYear)$('[name=buddhistYear]').value=String(options.currentBuddhistYear);if(options.me?.name)$('[name=managerName]').value=options.me.name;if(!canManage){setMessage('[data-award-status]','발급대장 저장은 관리자 권한이 필요합니다. 미리보기와 인쇄는 사용할 수 있습니다.','error');$('[data-issue]').disabled=true;}await loadLedger(1);};
      init().catch(error=>setMessage('[data-award-status]',error?.message||'초기화 중 오류가 발생했습니다.','error'));
    })();
  </script>

  <style is:global>
    .award-issue-panel,.award-ledger{margin-bottom:1.2rem}.section-title{display:flex;align-items:flex-start;justify-content:space-between;gap:1rem;margin-bottom:.9rem}.section-title h2{margin:0;font-size:1.13rem}.section-title p{margin:.25rem 0 0;color:var(--gov-muted);font-size:.82rem}.award-form-grid{align-items:start}.award-field-row{grid-column:1/-1;display:grid;gap:.8rem;align-items:start}.award-field-row--three{grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr))}.award-date-row [name="buddhistYear"][readonly]{background:#f5f7fa;color:#334155;font-weight:700}.appointment-body-preview>div{padding:.8rem 1rem;border:1px dashed #b8c8dd;border-radius:6px;background:#f7f9fc;white-space:pre-line;line-height:1.75;text-align:center;font-family:"Gungsuh","궁서",Batang,serif}.appointment-body-preview small,.field-help{color:var(--gov-muted);font-size:.74rem}.appointment-body-preview .award-sambo{font-weight:900;text-shadow:.2px 0 currentColor,-.2px 0 currentColor}[name="serialNo"][readonly]{background:#f5f7fa;color:#334155;font-weight:700}.award-actions{display:flex;justify-content:flex-end;gap:.6rem;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:.75rem}.award-ledger .section-title{align-items:flex-end}.award-ledger-filters{justify-content:flex-end}.award-ledger-filters input[type=search]{width:260px}.award-ledger [data-ledger-message]{text-align:right;margin-left:auto}.award-ledger-table{min-width:1260px;border-collapse:collapse!important;border-spacing:0!important}.award-ledger-table th,.award-ledger-table td{border:1px solid #aebed1!important;text-align:center!important;vertical-align:middle!important}.award-ledger-table th:nth-child(1){width:145px}.award-ledger-table th:nth-child(2){width:80px}.award-ledger-table th:nth-child(3),.award-ledger-table th:nth-child(4){width:105px}.award-ledger-table th:nth-child(5){width:120px}.award-ledger-table th:nth-child(6){width:145px}.award-ledger-table th:nth-child(7){width:95px}.award-ledger-table th:nth-child(8){width:95px}.award-ledger-table th:nth-child(9){width:70px}.award-ledger-table th:nth-child(10){width:225px}.award-manage{display:flex;justify-content:center;gap:.3rem;flex-wrap:wrap}.award-preview-modal{width:min(1050px,96vw);max-height:95vh;overflow:auto}.award-preview-modal .modal__body{padding:0;background:#e2e7ed}.award-preview-actions{position:sticky;bottom:0;display:flex;justify-content:flex-end;gap:.6rem;padding:.75rem 1rem;border-top:1px solid var(--gov-border);background:#fff;z-index:3}.award-paper-root{min-width:830px}.award-paper{box-shadow:0 4px 18px rgba(15,28,48,.18)}
    @media(max-width:1100px){.award-ledger .section-title{align-items:flex-start;flex-direction:column}.award-ledger-filters{justify-content:flex-start;width:100%}.award-ledger-filters input[type=search]{width:min(100%,320px)}}
    @media(max-width:700px){.award-actions .btn{flex:1}.award-field-row--three{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
  </style>
</ManagementLayout>
